RDP-server

Copyright (C) 2026 Keivan Moradi.

First-party open-source C++23 Remote Desktop Protocol server foundation,
distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later. This source is being migrated from the
historical xrdp-console research project. Imported code retains its original
authorship/licensing; the older upstream-derived C runtime and patched xrdp
daemon are not part of this project's standalone C++23 build.

The source archive does not currently provide a complete desktop server.
